This package was distilled from a user-authorized local Baidu Maps export session.
It contains no Baidu APK, third-party executable, personal trajectory dataset,
credential, Cookie, or private consumer API implementation.

The BD-09MC/BD-09LL/GCJ-02/WGS84 transformations preserve the numerical
implementation used in that session. These coordinate systems and commonly
circulated numerical formulas are not claimed as original inventions. The
retained session artifacts do not establish the earliest provenance of every
formula. No source files or binaries from TrajectoryCombine are redistributed.

